# Correction Task: Fix Missing `</ComboBox>` Closing Tags in XAML

## Found
The previous task (Simplify Aspect Ratio Options) replaced ComboBox items but accidentally removed the `</ComboBox>` closing tags in two files, causing XML parse errors at build time:

- `ImageAnalyzerWindow.xaml(432,35): error MC3000`
- `ImageGeneratorWindow.xaml(735,35): error MC3000`

Additionally, the Analyzer section ComboBox in `ImageGeneratorWindow.xaml` still has the old 7 items instead of the simplified 3.

## Fix Required

### 1. `FlipPix.UI/ImageAnalyzerWindow.xaml` — Line 411
Add `</ComboBox>` immediately after the last `<ComboBoxItem>` (line 411). The result should be:
```xml
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="Portrait 1632x2400"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="Landscape 2400x1632"/>
                                        <ComboBoxItem Content="Square 2400x2400"/>
                                    </ComboBox>
```
The `<Grid>` (Steps slider) that follows on line 412 stays where it is — it becomes a sibling of the ComboBox inside the Aspect Ratio StackPanel.

### 2. `FlipPix.UI/ImageGeneratorWindow.xaml` — Lines 631-637
Replace the 7 old ComboBoxItems with just the 3 new items, add `</ComboBox>`, and add `</StackPanel>` to close the Aspect Ratio section. Insert these between the last ComboBoxItem and the `<Expander>` on line 638.

The result (replacing lines 631-637) should be:
```xml
                                            <ComboBoxItem Content="Portrait 1632x2400"/>
                                            <ComboBoxItem Content="Landscape 2400x1632"/>
                                            <ComboBoxItem Content="Square 2400x2400"/>
                                        </ComboBox>
                                    </StackPanel>
```

**DO NOT** remove the `</StackPanel>` at line 735. After this fix, it will correctly close the main `<StackPanel>` opened at line 604. The nesting becomes:
- Line 604: `<StackPanel>` (main settings panel)
  - Line 608: Workflow `<StackPanel>` ... `</StackPanel>` (line 620)
  - Line 623: Aspect Ratio `<StackPanel>` ... `</StackPanel>` (NEW, after ComboBox close)
  - Line 638: `<Expander>` ... `</Expander>` (line 734)
- Line 735: `</StackPanel>` (closes main panel at 604)

### 3. Verify Build
After making both fixes, build the project:
```
dotnet build FlipPix.UI/FlipPix.UI.csproj
```
Fix any remaining XML errors if found.

## 4. Completion Instructions
Update this file with a "Changelog" section detailing your changes for my review.

